n></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.606" end="01:03.866"><span begin="00:56.606" end="00:56.856">It's </span><span begin="00:56.856" end="00:58.176">still </span><span begin="00:58.176" end="00:59.366">raining' </span><span begin="00:59.366" end="01:01.736">up </span><span begin="01:01.736" end="01:03.866">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.486" end="01:12.236"><span begin="01:06.486" end="01:08.176">Everybody </span><span begin="01:08.176" end="01:08.616">seems </span><span begin="01:08.616" end="01:09.356">so </span><span begin="01:09.356" end="01:09.866">far </span><span begin="01:09.866" end="01:10.926">away </span><span begin="01:10.926" end="01:11.176">from </span><span begin="01:11.176" end="01:12.236">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.366" end="01:20.486"><span begin="01:14.366" end="01:16.736">Everybody </span><span begin="01:16.736" end="01:17.426">just </span><span begin="01:17.426" end="01:17.796">wants </span><span begin="01:17.796" end="01:18.796">to </span><span begin="01:18.796" end="01:19.236">be </span><span begin="01:19.236" end="01:20.486">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.426" end="01:26.616"><span begin="01:22.426" end="01:22.736">Look </span><span begin="01:22.736" end="01:24.176">away </span><span begin="01:24.176" end="01:24.666">from </span><span begin="01:24.666" end="01:24.926">the </span><span begin="01:24.926" end="01:26.616">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.426" end="01:34.116"><span begin="01:28.426" end="01:28.606">It's </span><span begin="01:28.606" end="01:29.676">no </span><span begin="01:29.676" end="01:31.856">different </span><span begin="01:31.856" end="01:32.106">when </span><span begin="01:32.106" end="01:32.296">you're </span><span begin="01:32.296" end="01:32.676">leaving </span><span begin="01:32.676" end="01:34.116">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.226" end="01:43.796"><span begin="01:38.226" end="01:38.426">I </span><span begin="01:38.426" end="01:39.046">can't </span><span begin="01:39.046" end="01:39.426">be </span><span begin="01:39.426" end="01:39.736">the </span><span begin="01:39.736" end="01:40.236">same </span><span begin="01:40.236" end="01:40.926">thing </span><span begin="01:40.926" end="01:41.236">to </span><span begin="01:41.236" end="01:42.366">you </span><span begin="01:42.366" end="01:43.796">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.296" end="01:51.296"><span begin="01:44.296" end="01:44.486">I'm </span><span begin="01:44.486" end="01:45.366">just </span><span begin="01:45.366" end="01:48.486">gone' </span><span begin="01:48.486" end="01:49.486">just </span><span begin="01:49.486" end="01:51.296">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.796" end="01:59.426"><span begin="01:53.796" end="01:55.866">How </span><span begin="01:55.866" end="01:56.046">could </span><span begin="01:56.046" end="01:56.676">I </span><span begin="01:56.676" end="01:57.736">say </span><span begin="01:57.736" end="01:59.426">goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.616" end="02:08.236"><span begin="02:01.616" end="02:03.426">How </span><span begin="02:03.426" end="02:03.676">could </span><span begin="02:03.676" end="02:04.426">I </span><span begin="02:04.426" end="02:05.236">say </span><span begin="02:05.236" end="02:08.236">goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.486" end="02:13.366"><span begin="02:11.486" end="02:13.366">Goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.124" end="03:01.434"><span begin="02:56.124" end="02:56.494">Maybe </span><span begin="02:56.494" end="02:57.374">I'll </span><span begin="02:57.374" end="02:57.554">just </span><span begin="02:57.554" end="02:58.184">place </span><span begin="02:58.184" end="02:58.624">my </span><span begin="02:58.624" end="02:59.624">hands </span><span begin="02:59.624" end="03:00.494">over </span><span begin="03:00.494" end="03:01.434">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.374" end="03:08.934"><span begin="03:03.374" end="03:03.624">And </span><span begin="03:03.624" end="03:03.994">close </span><span begin="03:03.994" end="03:04.374">my </span><span begin="03:04.374" end="03:05.744">eyes </span><span begin="03:05.744" end="03:06.814">real </span><span begin="03:06.814" end="03:08.934">tight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.434" end="03:16.124"><span begin="03:11.434" end="03:11.874">There's </span><span begin="03:11.874" end="03:12.184">a </span><span begin="03:12.184" end="03:13.314">light </span><span begin="03:13.314" end="03:13.564">in </span><span begin="03:13.564" end="03:14.554">your </span><span begin="03:14.554" end="03:16.124">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.244" end="03:23.434"><span begin="03:17.244" end="03:17.494">And </span><span begin="03:17.494" end="03:17.934">you </span><span begin="03:17.934" end="03:20.184">know </span><span begin="03:20.814" end="03:21.244">yeah' </span><span begin="03:21.244" end="03:21.744">you </span><span begin="03:21.744" end="03:23.434">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.804" end="03:31.254"><span begin="03:26.804" end="03:26.994">Look </span><span begin="03:26.994" end="03:27.494">on </span><span begin="03:27.494" end="03:28.564">down </span><span begin="03:28.564" end="03:28.994">from </span><span begin="03:28.994" end="03:29.244">the </span><span begin="03:29.244" end="03:31.254">bridge</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.564" end="03:40.624"><span begin="03:32.564" end="03:32.874">I'm </span><span begin="03:32.874" end="03:34.184">still </span><span begin="03:34.184" end="03:36.934">waiting </span><span begin="03:36.934" end="03:37.624">for </span><span begin="03:37.624" end="03:40.624">you</span></p></div></body></tt>